#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapptemplate; generates &kde; templates to help you start easily &kde; "
"programming."
msgstr ""
"&kapptemplate; generira &kde; predloške koji Vam pomažu da jednostavno "
"započnete &kde; programiranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapptemplate; offers you a few basic templates projects and also picks up "
"KDevelop templates if some are installed on your machine."
msgstr ""
"&kapptemplate; Vam nudi nekoliko osnovnih predložaka projekata i također "
"uzima KDevelop predloške ukoliko ih ima instaliranih na Vašem računaru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "As default you will find:"
msgstr "Kao zadane vrijednosti ćete naći:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "A simple &kde; 4 &GUI; template"
msgstr "Jednostavan &kde; 4 &GUI; predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "A &kde; 4 KPart template"
msgstr "&kde; 4 KDio predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Qt4 main window based template"
msgstr "Predložak na bazi Qt4 osnovnog prozora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "A PyQt4 application"
msgstr "PyWt4 aplikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Py&kde;4 application"
msgstr "Py&kde;4 aplikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Ruby (korundum4) template"
msgstr "Ruby (korundum4) predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "A plasma applet template"
msgstr "Plasma aplet predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Answer the wizard questions on each page and generate your template."
msgstr ""
"Odgovori na čarobnjakova pitanja na svakoj stranici i generiši vlastiti "
"predložak."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A <filename>README</filename> file in each template will allow you to find "
"out how to build the template. It will also give you links for tutorials "
"related to the project. After the project is generated, &kapptemplate;'s job "
"is finished and you are on your own to build it."
msgstr ""
"<filename>PROČITAJME</filename> datoteka u svakom predlošku će Vam omogućiti "
"da naučite kako napraviti predložak. Također će Vam dati linkove za "
"tutorijale vezane za projekat. Nakon generisanja projekta, &kapptemplate;-ov "
"posao je završen i tada Vam samima preostaje da ga napravite."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kapptemplate;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kapptemplate;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapptemplate; is a wizard. The first page of the wizard explains you that "
"&kapptemplate; will generate a base project. Click <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton> to start generating your project. <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> "
"will stop the program and quit it. <guibutton>Help</guibutton> will display "
"this help handbook in &khelpcenter;."
msgstr ""
"&kapptemplate; je čarobnjak.  Prva stranica čarobnjaka Vam objašnjava da će "
"&kapptemplate; generirati bazni projekat. Kliknite  <guibutton>Sljedeće</"
"guibutton>za početak generisanja Vašeg projekta. <guibutton>Prekini</"
"guibutton> će zaustaviti program i izaći iz njega.<guibutton>Pomoć</"
"guibutton> će prikazati priručnik u &khelpcenter;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; first page</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; prva stranica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kapptemplate; first page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kapptemplate; prva stranica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second page lists the available templates. On the right you can see the "
"template preview and below the template description. After you chose your "
"template, you are invited to enter the project name in the field at the "
"bottom."
msgstr ""
"Druga stranica sadrži listu dostupnih predložaka. Na desnoj strani možete "
"vidjeti prikaz predloška, a ispod njega i njegov opis. Nakon što odaberete "
"Vaš predložak, pozvani ste da unesete ime projekta u polje na dnu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; second page</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; druga stranica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kapptemplate; second page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kapptemplate; druga stranica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On the third page, you are asked for the project version, the source folder "
"and the author name and email. If you filled &systemsettings; tab about your "
"personal information, it will be taken from there as default."
msgstr ""
"Na trećoj stranici se od Vas traži verzija projekta, izvor fascikle, ime "
"autora i njegova epošta. Ako ste popunili &systemsettings; sa svojim ličnim "
"podacima, ove informacije će biti preuzene  iz te fascikle."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; third page</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; treća stranica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kapptemplate; third page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kapptemplate; treća stranica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fourth and last page gives you some feedback about the project "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"Četvrta i zadnja stranica Vam daje povratnu informaciju o generaciji "
"projekta."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; fourth page</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kapptemplate; četvrta stranica</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kapptemplate; fourth page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kapptemplate; četvrta stranica</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Then click <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> to close &kapptemplate;."
msgstr ""
"Zatim kliknite <guibutton>Završi</guibutton> za zatvaranje &kapptemplate;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "What template do you need?"
msgstr "Koji Vam je preložak potreban?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter describes the templates so you can choose the one that is the "
"best adapted to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Ovo poglavlje opisuje predloške tako da možete izabrati onaj koji je najviše "
"prilagođen Vašim potrebama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "The C++ &kde; 4 &GUI; application template"
msgstr "C++ &kde; 4 &GUI; aplikacijski predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a CMake based &kde; 4 &GUI; template using KXMLGuiWindow and KConfig "
"XT. This is a &kde; 4 standard application."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je CMake baziran &kde; 4 &GUI; predlođak koristeći KXMLGuiWindow i "
"KConfig XT. Ovo je &kde; 4 standardna aplikacija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of the C++ &kde; 4 &GUI; application template"
msgstr "Ovo je snimka zaslona C** &kde; 4 &GUI; aplikacijskog predloška"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "C++ &kde; 4 &GUI; application template"
msgstr "C++ &kde; 4 &GUI; aplikacijski predložak"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This template demonstrates how you create &kde; menus using XMLGui and how "
"to use KConfig XT to change settings using the <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &lt;AppName&gt;</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj predložak Vam prikazuje kako da napravite &kde; menije korištenjem "
"XMLGui i kako koristiti KConfig XT za promjenu postavki korištenjem "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &lt;"
"AppName&gt;</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Don't forget to read the <filename>README</filename> in the project "
"directory. You can find some great tutorials for &kde; 4 on <ulink url="
"\"http://techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials\">http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Development/Tutorials</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Nemojte zaboraviti pročitati <filename>PROČITAJME</filename> u direktoriju "
"projekta. Možete naći odlične tutorijale za &kde; 4 na stranici <ulink url="
"\"http://techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials\">http://techbase.kde.org/"
"Development/Tutorials</ulink>."

