#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "The plasmoid application"
msgstr "Plazmoidna aplikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This template generates a simple plasma applet with an icon and some text on "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj predložak generira jednostavni plasma applet sa ikonicom i određenim "
"tekstom na njemu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kde; 4 plasma applet template</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>&kde;  4 plasma applet predložak </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kde; 4 plasma applet template</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>&kde; 4 plasma applet predlođak</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You need &kde; 4.1 to build this template and it uses CMake. You can read "
"more about it on <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/index.php?"
"title=Development/Tutorials/Plasma/GettingStarted\">http://techbase.kde.org/"
"index.php?title=Development/Tutorials/Plasma/GettingStarted</ulink>, all "
"methods are explained here."
msgstr ""
"Potreban Vam je &kde; 4.1 za kreiranje ovog predloška koji koristi CMake. "
"Možete pročitati više o tome na:  <ulink url=\"http://techbase.kde.org/index."
"php?title=Development/Tutorials/Plasma/GettingStarted\">http://techbase.kde."
"org/index.php?title=Development/Tutorials/Plasma/GettingStarted</ulink>, sve "
"metode su objašnjene ovdje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Restart plasma to load the applet by issuing <userinput>kquitapp plasma &amp;"
"&amp; plasma</userinput> or view it with <userinput>plasmoidviewer "
"YourAppletName</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Ponovo pokrenite plasmu da bi učitali applet pomoću <userinput>kquitapp "
"plasma &amp;&amp; plasma</userinput> ili ih pogledajte sa "
"<userinput>plasmoidPreglednik ImeVašegAppleta</userinput>."

